      "direction": "neutral_or_unclear",
      "decision_effect": "no_change",
      "card_ids": ["C154", "C171", "C185", "C152"]
    }
  ],
  "evidence_gaps": [
    "No direct absolute oral bioavailability measurement for the query molecule (bromocriptine) in the supplied records.",
    "No query-specific gut-wall efflux or intestinal metabolism data in L5; closest L5 records are for unrelated scaffolds.",
    "L3 ergot analogs are dihydro derivatives lacking the query's bromine and 9,10-unsaturation; DHE differs in side-chain composition.",
    "No formulation, dose, or human PK data for the query are supplied."
  ],
  "decision_summary": "L5 provides no query-relevant gut-wall efflux/intestinal-metabolism evidence; the low prediction is retained on the basis of structurally relevant L3 ergot-peptide low-exposure and first-pass records, with moderate confidence."
